<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετεωρ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετεώρισις</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				9
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ποδῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>IA</u>
					711b23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὅλου σώματος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				713a23
			</span></i>; <i>rising to the surface</i>, of roots, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.3.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>being raised up</i>: hence, <i>swelling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. γνώμης</span>
			<i>mental trouble</i> or <i>disturbance</i>, Id.<i>Acut.
			(Sp.</i>) <i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμης</span> is prob.
			interpol.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				185.20
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>wild thinking, vain imagining</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				831.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>delay, procrastination,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMasp.
				32.55
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
